refused: d326_a_literal_into_heap_text.cy:4:41, line 4 column 41
 4 |     let $log: str[len.max: inf bytes] = "abc";
   |                                         ^^^^^
 fix:  `str.from("abc", alloc: Lend $heap)`
 why:  anything that takes heap memory takes an allocator, so heap text comes from a call like `str.from(…, alloc: Lend $heap)` (D321, D326, D328, D369)
